  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"106\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"104\">About our brand and products:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"533\">Sempasi is a European brand of smart beauty devices designed to deliver professional skincare results at home. Our main products — <strong data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"259\">Sempasi Virgo Pro</strong>, <strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"278\">Sempasi Virgo</strong>, and&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"304\">Sempasi Pavo Pro</strong> — use advanced technologies such as thermotherapy, cryotherapy, sonic vibration, and ion therapy for facial lifting, wrinkle reduction, and skin rejuvenation.<br data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"466\">All products comply with CE, ROHS, ISO9001, and ISO13485 standards.</p><hr data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"538\"><h3 data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"574\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"572\">What makes us different:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"862\">Unlike most beauty gadgets, Sempasi devices combine professional-grade technology with ergonomic design and simple daily use.<br data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\">They offer visible results in just a few minutes per day — no salon appointments, no extra costs. Our products are safe, durable, and environmentally friendly.</p><hr data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"867\"><h3 data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"903\"><strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"901\">How affiliates can earn:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1174\">Affiliates earn a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"941\">high commission</strong> for every sale made through their unique link.<br data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"991\">With an above-average order value, even a few conversions can generate substantial earnings.<br data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1086\">Extra bonuses may be offered during campaigns such as <strong data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1156\">Black Friday</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1173\">Christmas</strong>.</p><hr data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1179\"><h3 data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1209\"><strong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1207\">How to promote us:</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1588\"><li data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1328\"><p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1328\">Create <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1235\">short videos</strong> on TikTok, Instagram Reels, or YouTube Shorts showing product use or before/after effects.</p></li><li data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1389\"><p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1389\">Write <strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1386\">blog reviews, unboxing posts, or testimonials</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1588\"><p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1588\">Promote through&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1447\">social media ads or organic content</strong> in beauty and skincare communities.<br data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1486\">Affiliates receive access to our official media kit, product images, and approved marketing materials.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1593\"><h3 data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1623\"><strong data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1621\">Other information:</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1848\"><li data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1657\"><p data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1657\"><strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1643\">Free shipping</strong> in Romania.</p></li><li data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1700\"><p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1700\"><strong data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1681\">12-month warranty</strong> for all devices.</p></li><li data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1741\"><p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1741\">Over <strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1738\">10,000 satisfied customers</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1777\"><p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1777\">Fast delivery from local stock.</p></li><li data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1848\"><p data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1848\">Direct support from the Sempasi marketing team for all affiliates.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
